@baseUrl = http://localhost:5231

### TEST 1 full
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search
Accept: application/json

### Test 2 Text Awalan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?search=Product Dummy 4
Accept: application/json

### Test 3 - Category dan Harga
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?minPrice=20000
Accept: application/json

### Test 4 - ASC DESC
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?sort=stock_asc
Accept: application/json

### TEST 5 - Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?page=2&pageSize=10&sort=price_desc&maxPrice=400000
Accept: application/json

### TEST 5 - Pagination tidak valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?page=2&pageSize=1000
Accept: application/json

### TEST 6 - Sort tidak valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?sort=abcd
Accept: application/json

### TEST 7 - MIN MAX tidak valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?minPrice=400000&maxPrice=200000
Accept: application/json



